38 (2018 \\u0439\\u0438\\u043b 8 \\u0441\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u044f\\u0431\\u0440\\u044c). \\u0441. 94-95\\n12. Tursunova N.N., \\u042d\\u043b\\u0435\\u043a\\u0442\\u0440\\u043e\\u043e\\u0431\\u043e\\u0440\\u0443\\u0434\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0436\\u0430\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432\\u0437\\u0440\\u044b\\u0432\\u043e\\u043e\\u043f\\u0430\\u0441\\u043d\\u044b\\u0445 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043c\\u0435\\u0449\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0438 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0440\\u0443\\u0436\\u043d\\u044b\\u0445 \\u0443\\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u043a \\u00ab\\u0420\\u043e\\u043b\\u044c \\u043d\\u0430\\u0443\\u043a\\u0438 \\u0438 \\u043e\\u0431\\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u044f \\u0432 \\u0440\\u0435\\u0448\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u0438 \\u044d\\u043a\\u043e\\u043b\\u043e\\u0433\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0445 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0431\\u043b\\u0435\\u043c\\u00bb \\u043c\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u0440\\u0438\\u0430\\u043b\\u044b \\u0440\\u0435\\u0441\\u043f\\u0443\\u0431\\u043b\\u0438\\u043a\\u0430\\u043d\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0439 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0443\\u0447\\u043d\\u043e-\\u043f\\u0440\\u0430\\u043a\\u0442\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0439 \\u043a\\u043e\\u043d\\u0444\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u043d\\u0446\\u0438\\u0438 (2018 \\u0439\\u0438\\u043b 8 \\u0441\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u044f\\u0431\\u0440\\u044c). \\u0441. 96-98\\n13. Tursunova N.N., Ekologik qonunchilikni buzganlik uchun javobgarlik \\u201cEkologik madaniyat: muammo va yechimlar\\u201d mavzusidagi respublika ilmiy-nazariy anjumani, Buxoro 2025. \\u201c176-178 b.\\n14. Tursunova N.N., Ekologik innovatsiyalar ekologik tarbiyaning umumiy ta\\u2019lim tizimidagi o\\u2018rni \\u201cEkologik madaniyat: muammo va yechimlar\\u201d mavzusidagi respublika ilmiy-nazariy anjumani, Buxoro 2025. 50-53 b.\\n15. Tursunova N.N., Ekologik tarbiyaning umumiy ta\\u2019lim tizimidagi o\\u2019rni \\u201cEkologik madaniyat: muammo va yechimlar\\u201d mavzusidagi respublika ilmiy-nazariy anjumani, Buxoro 2025. 15-17 b.\\n16. Tursunova N.N., \\u0421\\u0442\\u0440\\u0443\\u043a\\u0442\\u0443\\u0440\\u0430 \\u043e\\u0442\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0430 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0430 \\u0438 \\u0431\\u0435\\u0437\\u043e\\u043f\\u0430\\u0441\\u043d\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043f\\u0438\\u0449\\u0435\\u0432\\u044b\\u0445 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0434\\u0443\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u0432. Fan va texnologiyalar taraqqiyoti: ilmiy-texnikaviy jurnal. 2025. \\u21162\\/2025. 230-233 b.\\n17. Tursunova N.N., Mehnat sharoitlari buzilganda xodimlarning sog\\u2018lig\\u2018iga yetkazilgan zarar uchun ish beruvchining javobgarligi. \\u041c\\u0435\\u0436\\u0434\\u0443\\u043d\\u0430\\u0440\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u044b\\u0439 \\u0441\\u043e\\u0432\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u044b\\u0439 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0443\\u0447\\u043d\\u043e-\\u043f\\u0440\\u0430\\u043a\\u0442\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0436\\u0443\\u0440\\u043d\\u0430\\u043b \\u201c\\u041d\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043e\\u0431\\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u044f: \\u0438\\u0441\\u0441\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435 \\u0432 XXI \\u0432\\u0435\\u043a\\u0435\\u201d, \\u211631(100), \\u0444\\u0435\\u0432\\u0440\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c, \\u0447\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u044c 1, \\u041c\\u043e\\u0441\\u043a\\u0432\\u0430 2025, \\u0421. 228-232\\n18. Tursunova N.N., Tuproq zahiralari va ularning shamol ta\\u2019sirida eroziyaga uchrashi \\u201cKolloid kimyo: kimyoviy texnologiya, ekologiya va sanoat uchun innovatsiyalar va yechimlar\\u201d mavzusidagi xalqaro ilmiy-texnikaviy anjuman (2-sho\\u2019ba), 7 \\u2013 8 fevral, 2025. 936-939 b.\\n19. Tursunova N.N., Yangi O\\u2018zbekistonning atrof-muhit bo\\u2018yicha holati \\u201cKolloid kimyo: kimyoviy texnologiya, ekologiya va sanoat uchun innovatsiyalar va yechimlar\\u201d mavzusidagi xalqaro ilmiy-texnikaviy anjuman (4-sho\\u2019ba), 7 \\u2013 8 fevral, 2025. 318-322 b.\\n20. Tursunova N.N., O\\u0441\\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u043d\\u044b\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0447\\u043d\\u0438\\u043a\\u0438 \\u0437\\u0430\\u0433\\u0440\\u044f\\u0437\\u043d\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u044f \\u201cNeft, gaz va gazkondensatni qazib olish va tayyorlash jarayonidagi texnologik muammolarning innovatsion yechimlari\\u201d respublika miqyosidagi ilmiy-texnik anjuman to\\u2019plami, 14 \\u2013 15 noyabr, Buxoro, 2024. 424-426 b.\",\"KAFEDRA XORIJIY TA\\u2019LIM MUASSASALARI BILAN HAMKORLIK\\nBMTning-FAO tashkiloti, Yevropa Ittifoqining-Erasmus+ dasturi, AQSHning - Iowa Universiteti, Wyoming Universiteti, Kanadaning-Niagara College, Buyuk Britaniyaning -Surrey Universiteti, Germaniyaning-Humbolt nomidagi Berlin Universiteti, Ispaniyaning-Valensiya Politexnika Universiteti, Italiyaning-Turin Politexnika Universiteti, Rim Universiteti Vengriyaning- Szeged Universiteti, Obuda Universiteti, Vengriya Qishloq xo\'jaligi va Tabiiy fanlar Universiteti, Kiprning- Kipr Universiteti, Belorus Reskublikasining- Belorus Davlat Texnika Universiteti, Rossiya Federatsiyasining- K.A.Timiryazov nomidagi Moskva Davlat Agrar Universiteti, Kursk Davlat Agrar Universiteti, Turkiyaning- Yaqin Sharq Texnika Universiteti, Ushak Universiteti, Korea Respublikasining- Seul Universiteti, Malayziyaning-INTI Xalqaro Universiteti, Qozog\'iston Respublikasining- M.Auezov nomidagi Janubiy-Qozog\'iston Universities, Rossiya Federatsiyasining - Kursk davlat agrar universiteti, Malayziyaning INTI Xalqaro Universiteti, Turkiyaning Yaqin Sharq Texnika va Ushak Universiteti bilan hamkorlikda \\u201cModellashtirish, simulyatsiya va prototiplashtirish\\u201d ilmiy tadqiqotlar markazini tashkil etish rejalashtirildi. Xitoy Xalq Respublikasining Lanchjou Universiteti tomonidan qiymati 130 ming AQSh dollari qiymatiga teng bo\'lgan grand mablag\'lari hisobidan universititet bazasida \\\"Changni oldindan prognozlash\\\" qurilma-laboratoriyasi tashkil etilgan. Kafedra va Qozog\\u2019istonning M.Avezov nomidagi davlat universiteti o\\u2018rtasida hamkorlik memorandumi imzolangan bo\\u2018lib, universitetning \\u201cEkologiya\\u201d kafedrasi dotsenti \\u0414\\u0430\\u0443\\u0440\\u0435\\u043d\\u0431\\u0435\\u043a \\u041d\\u0430\\u0437\\u0430\\u0440\\u0431\\u0435\\u043a \\u041c\\u0443\\u0445\\u0430\\u0434\\u0434\\u0430\\u0441\\u0443\\u043b\\u0438, Qozoqistonning Qozoq-Turk universiteti dotsenti \\u041b\\u043e\\u0445\\u0430\\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430 \\u041a\\u0443\\u043b\\u0437\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430 \\u041c\\u0435\\u0440\\u0433\\u0435\\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u043d\\u0430 ilmiy maslahatchi sifatida kafedraga jalb qilingan. Bundan tashqari OTMlar o\\u2018rtasida talabalar va professor-o\\u2018qituvchilar almashinuvi yo\\u2019lga qo\\u2019yilgan.\",\"KAFEDRANING ISTIQBOLLI REJALARI\",\"1. Prospective work to further improve the quality of education:\\n1. Introduction of curricula and literature of foreign higher educational institutions, included in the TOP-300 list.\\n2. Improvement of curricula and relevant regulatory documents in the organization of the educational process in accordance with international standards and requirements of customers of personnel\\n3. Introduction of a system of training specialists on the basis of joint educational programs together with leading foreign higher education institutions ranking TOP-500.\\n4. Implementation of the dual form of education in cooperation with foreign organizations (enterprises) in selected areas on the basis of foreign experience.\\n5. Introduction of a system of education of students based on the DUAL education model in order to improve the quality of training.\\n6. Creation of new generation educational literature, their introduction in the educational process, and to constantly update the fund of the Information Resource Center.\\n7. The development of students\' critical and creative thinking, systematic analysis and entrepreneurial skills.\\n8. Organization and regulation of branches of specialty departments on the basis of partner organizations.\\n9. Organization of short-term advanced training (internship) of professors and teachers of specialty subjects in production enterprises and organizations of the republic.\\n10. Expansion of mutually beneficial and fruitful cooperation with leading foreign higher education institutions.\\n11. Improving the criteria for assessing students\' knowledge, skills and qualifications.\\n12. Expanding the contingent of international students by attracting foreign students to study and organizing the teaching staff of the department in foreign universities.\\n13. Organization of the academic process for students of foreign and domestic universities within the framework of academic mobility programs;\\n14. To ensure that university graduates find their place in society as competitively qualified personnel.\\n15. Focusing scientific research on solving problems of networks and expanding their integration and ensuring their effectiveness.\\n16. Increasing the scope of scientific work through the organization of scientific internships for researchers.\\n17. Identification of available opportunities for scientific capacity and taking appropriate measures.\\n18. Formation of promising university research areas of special attention to regional problems and orientation of research works of master\'s and doctoral students to the problems of economics, renewable energy, poverty alleviation.\\n19. Increase the publication of professors in journals indexed by Web of Science and Scopus databases.\\n20. Increasing the number of professors with the \\\"Hirsch\\\" index (h-index) 5 and above.\\n21. Participation in attracting foreign investments, grants and gratuitous support in value established by the administration of the university.\\nINTERACTIVE STUDENTS\"]}]', 'قسم البيئة الصناعية والهيدروجيولوجيا', 'According to the Decree of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan dated January 24, 2025 No. PP-22 \"On the organization of the Bukhara State Technical University\", as a result of the reorganization of the departments of Industrial Ecology and Ec', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:50');
INSERT INTO `department_translations` (`id`, `department_id`, `locale`, `name`, `short_name`, `description`, `content_sections`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('45', '12', 'en', 'Department of Vehicle Engineering (Automotive & Transport Systems)', 'Vehicle Engineering (Automotive & Transport Systems)', 'In 2020, a new structural unit was organized within the faculty of \"Mechanical Engineering and Architecture Construction\" - \"Fundamentals of Mechanics and Ground Transport Systems\". The establishment of this department arose from the need to train highly qualified specialists in the field of modern transport systems, agricultural engineering and mechanical engineering. The department\'s activity is directed on the development of engineering education, the organization of scientific and pedagogical activities on the study and rational use of transport technologies.', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"Overview\",\"items\":[\"Department of Vehicle Engineering     \\n\\nKafedra mudiri, Associate Professor\\nGaffarov Hasan Ravshanovich\\n Reception time: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\\n Phone: +998 97 306 07 37\\n Email: -\"]},{\"key\":\"history\",\"title\":\"Department History\",\"items\":[\"In 2020, a new structural unit was organized within the faculty of \\\"Mechanical Engineering and Architecture Construction\\\" - \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and Ground Transport Systems\\\". The establishment of this department arose from the need to train highly qualified specialists in the field of modern transport systems, agricultural engineering and mechanical engineering. The department\'s activity is directed on the development of engineering education, the organization of scientific and pedagogical activities on the study and rational use of transport technologies.\",\"1970-2019 \\u2013 M.M. Murodov., D.SH. Bazarbaeva., N.S.Bibutov., N.M.Muradov., SH. M. Muradov, Kh. R. Ruziev worked in the headship. In August 2019, the department was renamed into the chair \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and ETT\\\", and the chair was headed by Kh.R.Gaffarov.In 2021, due to the change in the internal structure of the Institute, the department \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and ETT\\\" was divided into the departments \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics\\\" and \\\"Engineering of vehicles\\\". As the head of the Department of \\\"Vehicle engineering\\\" is docent. Kh.R. Gaffarov works.\",\"Since 2021, the department has been renamed \\\"Department of Vehicle Engineering\\\" in accordance with the field. The name of the department was changed in order to expand the scientific and pedagogical activity of the department, to cover modern directions in the field of transport engineering and to bring the educational process into line with international requirements. In the initial period of creation of the department there were two directions, namely:\\n60810100 - Mechanization of agriculture,\\n\\u2022 5310600 - Land transport systems and their operation (motor transport).\\nDuring that period, 8 professors and teachers worked at the department. They include 1 associate professor, 2 senior lecturers, 3 assistants and 2 trainee teachers. At the department, education at the bachelor\'s level was initially provided, but the master\'s degree was not provided. In subsequent years, scientific and pedagogical potential and material and technical base of the department were significantly developed. As a result, the number of areas of education has been expanded, and today the department trains highly qualified personnel in 9 directions of education at the undergraduate level and 3 specialties at the master\'s level. Currently, 36 professors and staff work at the department. They include 1 professor, 12 associate professors, 3 senior lecturers, 7 assistants, 12 trainee teachers, and 2 laboratory assistants. The scientific and pedagogical team of the department pays special attention to the organization of the educational process on the basis of modern pedagogical technologies, strengthening the integration with the development and production of scientific research. In order to improve the educational process, the professors and teachers of the department have compiled more than 20 textbooks and teaching aids. They also publish a lot of scientific articles in national and international scientific journals and conduct research works in such areas as vehicle engineering, agricultural engineering, transport systems operation. This research contributes to the development of industry, increasing the efficiency of transport systems, as well as developing modern engineering solutions.\",\"Nowadays, the department \\\"Transport Engineering\\\" with its scientific potential, qualified professors and teaching staff is acting as one of the leading departments of the faculty.\"]},{\"key\":\"staff\",\"title\":\"Professor-Teachers of the Department\",\"items\":[\"Head of the department, candidate of technical sciences, Professor\\nGafforov Hasan Ravshanovich\",\"Candidate of the Technical Sciences, associate professor\\nUrinov Nasillo Fayzilloyevich\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD), associate professor\\nNorov Sobir Negmurodovich\",\"Associate Professor\\nSaidova Mukhabbat Khamroyevna\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD), associate professor\\nAmonov Mahmud Idris oglu\",\"Candidate of Technical Sciences, Associate Professor.\\nDuskarayev Nartaylak\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD) associate Professor\\nJurayev Toyir Omonovich\",\"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD),associate professor\\nAdizova Sevara Yusupovna\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nFazliyev Jamoliddin Sharofiddinovich\",\"Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nHakimova Zarina Ziyodilloyevna\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nXalilov Jahongir Mansur o\\u2019g\\u2019li\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nRajabov Bobir Bozorovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchit\\nKamolov Muhiddin Qurbonovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nBafoyev Dustmurod Xolmurodovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nYuliyev Ozod Olimovich\",\"Assistent\\nSamandarov Ali Xayrullayevich\",\"Assistent\\nJumayev Ulug\\u2019bek Rustamovich\",\"Assistent\\nHaydarova Nargiza Dilmurod qizi\",\"Asistent\\nAbdullayeva Dilnavoz Xusniddinovna\",\"Assistent\\nHojiyev Oybek Odinayevich\"]},{\"key\":\"prepared_specialists\",\"title\":\"Prepared Specialists\",\"items\":[\"BAKALAVRIAT\\n\\u2022 60712300 \\u2013 Mexanika muhandisligi\\n\\u2022 60711300 \\u2013 Metallar texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 60720300 \\u2013 Materialshunoslik\\n\\u2022 60810100 \\u2013 Qishloq xo\'jaligini mexanizatsiyalashtirish\\n\\u2022 60711400 \\u2013 Transport vositalari muhandisligi\\n\\u2022 60720800 \\u2013 Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi, mashinasozlik ishlab chiqarishini jihozlash va avtomatlashtirish\\n\\u2022 60720600 \\u2013Materialshunoslik va yangi materiallar texnologiyasi (mashinasozlik)\\n\\u2022 60712500 \\u2013 Transport vositalari muhandisligi (turlari bo\\u2018yicha) (avtomobil transporti)\\n\\u2022 60810100 \\u2013 Qishloq xo\'jaligini mexanizatsiyalashtirish (SIRTQI)\\nMAGISTRATURA\\n\\u2022 70712301- Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 70712301- Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 70711401 - Transport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti bo\\u2019yicha)\",\"KAFEDRADA O\\u2018QITILADIGAN FANLAR\\nBakalavriat:\\n1. Yo\\u2018nalishga kirish\\n2. Quymakorlik qotishmalari\\n3. Raqamli dasturda boshqariladigan texnologik jihozlar va tizimlar\\n4. Tokarlik ishi\\n5. Gidravlika\\n6. Kesish nazariyasi va kesuvchi asboblar\\n7. Materialshunoslik va muhandislik asoslari; integratsion yondashuv\\n8. Materialshunoslikning fundamental asoslari\\n9. Termik ishlov berish texnologiyasi\\n10. Nometall materiallar texnologiyasi\\n11. Gidravlika va gidravlik tizimlar\\n12. Materialshunoslik va konstruksion materiallar texnologiyasi\\n13. Tuproqshunoslik va dehqonchilik\\n14. Chorvachilik mahsulotlarini yetishtirish texnologiyasi\\n15. Zamonaviy kasblarga o\'rgatish\\/Tiklanuvchan energiya manbalari\\n16. Materialshunoslik\\n17. Gidravlika va gidravlik yuritmalar\\n18. Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi asoslari\\n19. Quymakorlik texnologiyalari\\n20. Mashinasozlik ishlab chiqarishini loyihalash\\n21. Zagotovkalarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n22. Yangi materiallar texnologiyasi\\n23. Korroziya va undan himoyalashning usullari\\n24. Metallarga bosim ostida ishlov berish\\n25. Materiallarni tuzilishi va detallar sifati nazorati\\n26. Kukun kompozitsion materiallar\\n27. Traktorlar va transport vositalari\\n28. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi mashinalari\\n29. Kasb mahorati\\/ Muhandislik-texnik ishlarni dasturiy modellashtirish\\n30. Aniq qishloq xo\'jalik tizimlari\\n31. Ichki yonuv dvigatellari\\/Yashil iqtisod\\n32. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi ishlab chiqarishni mexanizatsiyalashtirish\\/Yonilg\\u2019I moylash materiallari\\n33. Avtomatlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarish texnologiyasi\\n34. Avtomatlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarishning texnologik jihozlari\\n35. Mashinasozlikning maxsus kursi\\n36. Mashinasozlikda innovatsion texnika va texnologiyalar\\n37. Mashinasozlikda ishlab chiqarish jarayonlarini avtomatlashtirish asoslari\\n38. Frezalash ishi\\n39. Texnik tizimlarni boshqarish\\n40. Qizdirish qurilmalari\\n41. Kukunli kompozitsion materiallarvz\\n42. Quymakorlik texnologiyalari\\n43. Materiallar tuzilishi va detallar sifatini nazorati\\n44. Asbobsozlik materiallari\\n45. Korroziya va undan himoyalash usullari\\n46. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi ishlab chiqarishni mexanizatsialash\\n47. Yo\\u2019l harakati qoidalari va harakat xavfsizligi\\/ Bog\\u2019dorchilik va sabzavotchilik mashinalari\\n48. Qishloq xo\\u2019jalik texnika va texnologiyalardan foydalanish va texnik servis\\n49. Innavatsion texnika va ularning transferi\\n50. Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi (maxsus kurs)\\n51. Texnologik moslamalarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n52. Avtomatlashtirilgan uchastka va sexlarni loyihalash\\nMagistratura\\n1. Ilmiy tadqiqot metodologiyasi\\n2. Mashinasozlikda kesuvchi asboblarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n3. Dastgohlar va dastgohli tizimlarni hisoblash va konstruksiyalash\\n4. Mashinalar va jarayonlar puxtaligi\\n5. Ilmiy-tadqiqot ishi va magistrlik dissertatsiyasini tayyorlash\\n6. Ilmiy-pedagogik ish\\n7. Mashinasozlikda resurstejamkor texnologiyalar\\n8. Mashinasozlikda aniqlik va uning texnologik ta\\u2019minoti\\n9. Raqamli dastur bilan boshqariladigan dastgohlar va dastgohli komplekslar\\n10. Maxsus fanlarni o\\u2018qitish metodikasi\\n11. Mashinasozlikda resurs tejamkor texnologiyalar\\n12. Ilmiy amaliyot (tajriba orttirish)\\n13. Transport vositalari va tizimlarining ishonchliligi loyihalash\\n14. Avtomobil transport vositalari va uni texnik ekspluatatsiyasining istiqbolli rivojlanishi\\n15. Texnologik jarayonlarini boshqarish va eksperimentlarini rejalashtirish\\n16. Avtomobillar texnik ekspluatatsiyasining meyorlarini aniqlashtirish usullari\\n17. Avtomobil transportida moddiy texnik ta\\u2019minot va resurslarni tejash\\n18. Avtotransport vositalarini ishlash qobiliyatini ta\\u2019minlash\\n19. Qiyosiy muhandislik\\n20. Qishloq xo\\u2019jalik mashinalarining yangi texnik yechimlari\\n21. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi mashinalari nazariyasi hisobi\\n22. Ilmiy tadqiqot usullari va eksplatatsiyasi\"]},{\"key\":\"publications\",\"title\":\"Textbooks and Articles\",\"items\":[\"DARSLIK VA O\\u2018QUV QO\\u2018LLANMALAR\\n1. O\'rinov U.A., Amonov M.I., Yo\'ldoshev M.N. \\u201cMashinasozlik texnologiyasi asoslari\\u201d \\u2013 Buxoro. \\u201cSharq\\u201d nashriyoti. 2025y.\\n2. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u0410vtotransport tarmog\\u02bci korxonalarni loyihalash va jihozlash Darslik. Buxoro: Umid 2023, 444 b.\\n3. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u201c\\u0410vtomobillarni texnik diagnostikalash\\u201d Darslik. Buxoro: Umid. 2023, 216 b.\\n4. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u201cTransport vositalarining elektr jihozlari va elektron tizimlari\\u201d. Darslik. Buxoro: