n25. N.F.O\\u2019rinov, \\u041c.\\u0425.Saidova Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi fanidan kurs loyihasi. (60720800 - Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi, mashinasozlik ishlab chiqarishni jihozlash va avtomatlashtirish bakalavriat ta\\u2019lim yo\\u2018nalishida tahsil olayotgan talabalar uchun) O\\u2019quv qo\\u2019llanma. Buxoro, \\u201cUmid\\u201d nashriyoti, 2022. 195 b.\\n26. Bafoyev Dusmurod Xolmurodovich \\u201cGidravlika va gidropnevmo yuritmalar\\u201d \\u2116 DGU 45598, Talabnoma raqami: DT 202413595.14.12.2024.\\n27. O\'rinov Nasillo Fayzilloyevich Mashina detallari \\u2116 DGU 45023, Talabnoma raqami: DT 202412687.04.12.2024.\\n28. Saidova Muxabbat Xamroyevna Kesish nazariyasi va kesuvchi asboblar \\u2116 DGU 45022, Talabnoma raqami: DT 202412686. 04.12.2024.\\n29. Abdullayeva Dilnavoz Xusniddinovna Avtomatlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarishning texnologik jihozlari \\u2116 DGU 44164, Talabnoma raqami: DT 202412186.19.11.2024.\\n30. Saidov Muxtor Nutfullayevich \\u201cTrasport vositalarida ishlatiladigan ekspluatatsion materiallar\\u201d fanidan DGU 202402611.10.03.2024.\\n31. Saidov Muxtor Nutfullayevich \\u201cTransport vositalarining elektr va elektron jihozlari\\u201d fanidan elektron darslik. DGU 202405365. 02.05.2024.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Research Work\",\"items\":[\"KAFEDRADA OLIB BORILAYOTGAN ILMIY ISHLAR\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 05.07.01 \\u2013 \\u201cQishloq xo\\u02bbjaligi va melioratsiya mashinalari. Qishloq xo\\u02bbjaligi va melioratsiya ishlarini mexanizatsiyalash\\u201d\\n1. Gaffarov Xasan Ravshanovich - Paxta yetishtirish zonasida yer osti tuproq qatlamini yumshatish uchun asbobning texnologik jarayonini takomillashtirish va parametrlarini asoslash.\\n2. Norov Sobirjon Negmurodovich - Yer tekisl\\u0430sh m\\u0430shin\\u0430l\\u0430ri shnekli ish org\\u0430nl\\u0430rining p\\u0430r\\u0430metrl\\u0430rini \\u0430sosl\\u0430sh.\\n3. Xalilov Jahongir Mansur o\\u2019g\\u2019li - Intensiv bog\\u2018 qator oralariga ishlov beradigan takomillashgan mashina ish organlarining parametrlarini asoslash.\\n4. Rajabov Bobir Bozorovich - Keng qamrovli chizel-kultivatorga dala yuzasini tekislaydigan va unda mayin tuproq qatlamini hosil qiladigan moslama ishlab chiqish va parametrlarini asoslash.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 05.02.14 - \\u201cOziq-ovqat mashina va apparatlari\\u201d\\n1. O\\u2019rinov Nasullo Fayzulloyevich - Oziq -ovqat maxsulotlarini kesuvchi mashinalarining ish samaradorligini oshirish.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 05.02.03 \\u2013 \\u201cTexnologik mashinalar. Robotlar, mexatronika va robotatexnika tizimlari.\\u201d\\n1. Ismoyilov Ibrohim Barotovich \\u2013 Junni titish mashinasi konstruksiyasini takomillashtirish va ishchi parametrlarini asoslash.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 05.02.01 \\u2013 \\u201cMashinasozlikda materialshunoslik.\\n1. \\u201cQuymachilik. Metallarga termik va bosim ostida ishlov berish. Qora, rangli va noyob metallar metallurgiyasi. Kamyob, nodir va radioaktiv elementlar texnologiyasi\\u201d.\\n1.Duskarayev Nortoyloq - Ko\\u2019p shpindelli tokarlik stanoklariga sozlab turgichni ishlab chiqish.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 13.00.05- \\u201cKasb \\u2013hunar ta\\u2019limi nazariyasi va metodikasi\\u201d:\\n1.O\\u2019rinov Uyg\\u2019un Abdullayevich - Texnik\\u0430 oliy t\\u0430\\u2019lim mu\\u0430ss\\u0430s\\u0430l\\u0430ri v\\u0430 ishl\\u0430b chiq\\u0430rish korxon\\u0430l\\u0430ri h\\u0430mkorligid\\u0430 t\\u0430l\\u0430b\\u0430l\\u0430rning \\u0430m\\u0430liy ko\\u02bcnikm\\u0430l\\u0430rini rivojl\\u0430ntirish mex\\u0430nizmini t\\u0430komill\\u0430shtirish.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 13.00.02 \\u2013 \\u201cTa\\u2019lim va tarbiya nazariyasi va metodikasi\\u201d:\\n1. Adizova Sevara Yusupovna - Inn\\u043ev\\u0430tsi\\u043en y\\u043end\\u0430shuv \\u0430s\\u043esid\\u0430 t\\u0430l\\u0430b\\u0430l\\u0430rni yuq\\u043eri texn\\u043el\\u043egik k\\u043erx\\u043en\\u0430l\\u0430rd\\u0430gi k\\u0430sbiy f\\u0430\\u043eliy\\u0430tg\\u0430 t\\u0430yy\\u043erl\\u0430sh met\\u043edik\\u0430sini t\\u0430k\\u043emill\\u0430shtirish.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 02.00.16 - \\u201cKimyo texnologiyasi va oziq-ovqat ishlab chiqarish jarayonlari va apparatlari\\u201d:\\n1. Amonov Maxmud Idrisovich - Tayyor unli mahsulotlarni kesish texnologik jarayonlarini o\\u2018rganish va qurilmalarni takomillashtirish.\\n2. Sohibov Ibodillo Adizmurodovich - Yumshoq unli yarimtayyor mahsulotlarni kesish bosqichida qo\\u2018llaniladigan texnologik uskunani takomillashtirish.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 06.01.02 - \\u201cMelioratsiya va sug\'orma dehqonchilik\\u201d:\\n1. Fazliyev Jomoliddin Sharofiddinovich - Bog\\u2018larni tomchilatib sug\\u2018orishning ilmiy asoslangan texnologiyasini ishlab chiqish (Buxoro viloyati misolida).\\n2. Hakimova Zarina Ziyodullayevna - Qishloq xo\\u02bcj\\u0430ligi ekinl\\u0430rini sug\\u02bcorishd\\u0430 m\\u0430ishiy oqov\\u0430 suvl\\u0430rid\\u0430n foyd\\u0430l\\u0430nish s\\u0430m\\u0430r\\u0430dorligi.\\nIxtisoslik bo\\u2019yicha: 01.02.04 \\u2013 \\u201cDeformatsiyalanuvchan qattiq jism mexanikasi\\u201d:\\n1.Jo\\u2019rayev Toyir Omonovich - Elastik yarim tekislikda joylashgan inshootlarda turg\\u02bcun bo\\u02bclmagan to\\u02bclqinlar ta\\u02bcsiri xususiyatlari\",\"KAFEDRA XORIJIY TA\\u2019LIM MUASSASALARI BILAN HAMKORLIK\\n1. \\u201cAvto Service Inter Millennium\\u201d MCHJ\\n2. \\u201cVobkent Yulduzi Texservis\\u201d MCHJ\\n3. \\u201cBuxoro Avtotexxizmat\\u201d MCHJ\\n4. \\u201cVatanparvar\\u201d tashkilotining Buxoro viloyat kengashi.\\n5. \\u201cNeftgazavtotransxizmat\\u201d UK.\\n6. \\u201cMaxsus avtotrans xizmat\\u201d MCHJ.\\n7. \\u201cBuxsozta\\u2019mirservis\\u201d ishlab chiqarish kooperativi.\\n8. \\u201cNasos ta\\u2019mirlash\\u201d MCHJ.\\n9. \\u201cTrubodetal\\u201d UK.\\n10. \\u201cAlixan trans servis\\u201d MCHJ.\\n11. \\u201cUsmon sher shamshod\\u201d MCHJ.\\n12. \\u201cLosha qurilish sanoat komplekkt\\u201d MCHJ.\\n13. \\\"Emirate steel\\\" MChJv 14. \\u201cXXI metall works Buxara\\u201d MChJ\\n15. \\u201cKo\\u2018hna Buxoro ta\\u2019mir\\u201d MChJ 16. \\\"Losha qurilish sanoat komplekt\\\" xususiy korxonasi.\",\"Xalqaro homkorlik tashkilotlari.\\n1. Emirate Steel - mas\\u2019uliyati cheklangan jamiyat xorijiy korxonasi.\\n2. \\u00abENTER MASHINERIES SERVICE\\u00bb - mas\\u2019uliyati cheklangan jamiyat xorijiy korxonasi.\\n3. Head of China Nuclear Industry 22ND Construction CO., LTD: - mas\\u2019uliyati cheklangan jamiyat xorijiy korxonasi.\\n4. \\u00abMERMER GURLUSHYK\\u00bb - mas\\u2019uliyati cheklangan jamiyat xorijiy korxonasi.\",\"KAFEDRANING ISTIQBOLLI REJALARI\\nTransport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti)\\u201d yo\\u2018nalishi bo\\u2018yicha 5 yillik istiqbolli rivojlanish rejasi (2026\\u20132030)\\nJahon iqtisodiyotida transport tizimi muhim strategik tarmoqlardan biri hisoblanadi. Ayniqsa avtomobil transporti sohasi jadal sur\\u2019atlarda rivojlanib, yangi texnologiyalar, raqamli boshqaruv tizimlari va ekologik talablar bilan boyib bormoqda. Elektr transport vositalari, intellektual transport tizimlari, avtomatlashtirilgan boshqaruv va raqamli diagnostika kabi innovatsion texnologiyalar transport sohasini tubdan o\\u2018zgartirmoqda. O\\u2018zbekiston Respublikasida ham transport infratuzilmasini modernizatsiya qilish, logistika tizimini takomillashtirish va zamonaviy transport texnologiyalarini joriy etish bo\\u2018yicha keng ko\\u2018lamli islohotlar amalga oshirilmoqda. Bu esa transport sohasi uchun yuqori malakali muhandis kadrlar tayyorlashni yanada takomillashtirish zaruratini keltirib chiqaradi. \\u201cTransport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti)\\u201d ta\\u2019lim yo\\u2018nalishi bo\\u2018yicha mutaxassislar tayyorlash tizimini rivojlantirish, ta\\u2019lim mazmunini zamonaviy talablarga moslashtirish va ilmiy tadqiqotlar salohiyatini oshirish mazkur strategiyaning asosiy vazifalaridan hisoblanadi.\\nRejaning asosiy maqsadi: Oliy ta\\u2019lim muassasalarida transport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti) sohasi bo\\u2018yicha zamonaviy bilim, amaliy ko\\u2018nikma va innovatsion fikrlashga ega mutaxassislar tayyorlash tizimini takomillashtirish, hamda transport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti) ta\\u2019lim yo\\u2018nalishini xalqaro standartlar asosida rivojlantirish, raqobatbardosh muhandis kadrlar tayyorlash tizimini shakllantirishdan iborat.\\nAsosiy vazifalar sifatida quyidagi mezonlar qabul qilindi.\\n1.ta\\u2019lim dasturlarini xalqaro standartlar asosida yangilash\\n2.zamonaviy laboratoriya va o\\u2018quv bazasini rivojlantirish\\n3.sanoat korxonalari bilan integratsiyani kuchaytirish\\n4.raqamli texnologiyalar va \\u201cyashil transport\\u201d yo\\u2018nalishlarini joriy etish\\n5.professor-o\\u2018qituvchilarning ilmiy salohiyatini oshirish\\n6.talabalarning amaliy va innovatsion faolligini kuchaytirish\\n7. xalqaro hamkorlik va akademik mobillikni rivojlantirish\\nI. 5 yillik bosqichma-bosqich rivojlanish rejasi\\n1-yil (2026) \\u2013 Ta\\u2019lim dasturini modernizatsiya qilish\\nAsosiy yo\\u2018nalishlar:\\n1.O\\u2018quv rejalarini xalqaro standartlar (ABET, EUR-ACE) asosida qayta ko\\u2018rib chiqish\\n2.Zamonaviy fanlarni kiritish:\\nA)Elektr va gibrid avtomobillar\\nV)Avtomobil elektronikasi\\nS)Intellektual transport tizimlari\\nD)CAD\\/CAE modellashtirish\\n3.o\\u2018quv jarayoniga raqamli platformalarni joriy qilish\\n4.korxonalar bilan dual ta\\u2019lim mexanizmlarini ishlab chiqish\\nTa\\u2019lim jarayonini raqamlashtirish izchil amalga oshiriladi. Raqamli texnologiyalar ta\\u2019lim jarayonini samarali tashkil etish imkonini beradi. Bunda asosiy yo\\u2018nalishlar elektron ta\\u2019lim platformalari, virtual laboratoriyalar, transport tizimlarini modellashtirish dasturlari, hamda masofaviy ta\\u2019lim tizimi amalga oshiriladi. Birinchi yil ta\\u2019lim dasturini modernizatsiya qilish oqali yangilangan bakalavr ta\\u2019lim dasturi va sanoat talablariga mos kompetensiyalar ishlab chiqiladi.\\n2-yil (2027) \\u2013 Moddiy-texnik bazani kuchaytirish Ikkinchi yilda quyidagi tadbirlar amalga oshiriladi. Bunda yangi laboratoriyalarni tashkil etish nazarda tutilgan:\\n1.Avtomobil diagnostikasi laboratoriyasi\\n2.Elektromobillar laboratoriyasi\\n3.Dvigatellar sinov laboratoriyasi\\n4.Avtomobil elektronikasi laboratoriyasi\\n5.simulyator va virtual laboratoriyalar joriy etish\\n6.CAD\\/CAM\\/CAE dasturlari (SolidWorks, MATLAB, ANSYS) bilan ta\\u2019minlash\\n7.Transport modellashtirish markazi\\nInfratuzilmani modernizatsiya qilish\\nTa\\u2019lim jarayonini samarali tashkil etish uchun zamonaviy infratuzilma zarur bo\\u2018ladi. Ikkinchi yilda Kutilayotgan natijalar amaliyotga yo\\u2018naltirilgan ta\\u2019limni shakllantirish va talabalarning muhandislik ko\\u2018nikmalari oshirishdan iborat.\\n3-yil (2028) \\u2013 Ilmiy tadqiqot va innovatsiyalarni rivojlantirish\\nAmalga oshiriladigan tadbirlar:\\n\\u2022 \\u201cInnovatsion transport texnologiyalari\\u201d ilmiy markazini tashkil etish\\n\\u2022 talabalar startap loyihalarini qo\\u2018llab-quvvatlash\\n\\u2022 ilmiy grantlar va xalqaro loyihalarda ishtirok\\n\\u2022 ilmiy jurnallarda maqolalar sonini oshirish\\nAsosiy tadqiqot yo\\u2018nalishlari: elektr transport, yoqilg\\u2018i tejamkor dvigatellar, ekologik transport intellektual transport tizimlari Uchinchi yilda ilmiy ishlanmalar patentlar va innovatsion loyihalar amalga oshiriladi. Sanoat bilan integratsiyani kuchaytirish orqali ta\\u2019lim tizimini ishlab chiqarish bilan integratsiya qilish kadrlar tayyorlash samaradorligini oshiradi. Bu borada: \\u2022 transport korxonalari bilan hamkorlik shartnomalari tuzish;\\n\\u2022 dual ta\\u2019lim tizimini joriy qilish;\\n\\u2022 talabalarni ishlab chiqarish amaliyotlariga keng jalb qilish;\\n\\u2022 korxona mutaxassislarini ta\\u2019lim jarayoniga jalb qilish rejalashtiriladi.\\n\\u2022 Ishlab chiqarishdagi muammolar o\\u2018rganiladi va mummolarni yechimlari bo\\u2018yicha amaliy tavsiyalar ishlab chiqiladi.\\nIlmiy tadqiqot faoliyati rivojlantiriladi. Ilmiy tadqiqotlar transport sohasidagi innovatsiyalarni rivojlantirish uchun xizmat qiladi. Asosiy yo\\u2018nalishlari sifatida energiya samarador transport vositalari, ekologik toza transport, avtomobil diagnostikasi tizimlari va transport logistikasini optimallashtirish kabi yo\\u2018nalishlar kiritildi.\\n4-yil (2029) \\u2013 Xalqaro hamkorlikni kengaytirish\\nTadbirlar:\\n\\u2022 xorijiy universitetlar bilan qo\\u2018shma ta\\u2019lim dasturlari\\n\\u2022 akademik almashinuv dasturlari\\n\\u2022 qo\\u2018shma ta\\u2019lim dasturlari\\n\\u2022 xorijiy professorlarni jalb qilish\\n\\u2022 qo\\u2018shma ilmiy konferensiyalar o\\u2018tkazish\\n\\u2022 xalqaro loyihalar\\n\\u2022 innovatsion texnopark tashkil qilish\\n\\u2022 To\\u2018rtinchi yilda kutilayotgan natijalar xalqaro standartlarga mos ta\\u2019lim va talabalar va o\\u2018qituvchilarning global tajribasi\\n5-yil (2030) \\u2013 Ta\\u2019lim sifati va barqaror rivojlanish\\nTadbirlar:\\n\\u2022 ta\\u2019lim dasturini xalqaro akkreditatsiyadan o\\u2018tkazish\\n\\u2022 sanoat korxonalari bilan uzoq muddatli hamkorlik\\n\\u2022 raqamli ta\\u2019lim muhitini to\\u2018liq joriy qilish\\n\\u2022 o\\u2018qituvchilarni malakasini oshirish\\n\\u2022 ilmiy darajali kadrlar ulushini oshirish\\n\\u2022 yosh olimlarni qo\\u2018llab quvvatlash\\n\\u2022 bitiruvchilarning ish bilan ta\\u2019minlanish monitoringi\\nBeshinchi yilda kutiladigan natijalar xalqaro tan olingan ta\\u2019lim dasturi va yuqori malakali muhandis kadrlar tayyorlanishiga erishiladi. Ta\\u2019lim jarayoniga raqamli texnologiyalarni joriy qilish talabalarning bilim olish imkoniyatlarini kengaytiradi. Bunda onlayn ta\\u2019lim platformalarini joriy qilish; virtual laboratoriyalardan foydalanish; raqamli ta\\u2019lim resurslarini ishlab chiqish nazarda tutiladi.\\nMoliyaviy barqarorlik quyidagi manbalar orqali ta\\u2019minlanadi:\\n1)ilmiy grantlar\\n2)sanoat korxonalari bilan hamkorlik\\n3) konsalting xizmatlari\\n4)innovatsion ishlanmalarni tijoratlashtirish\\nII. Kutilgan asosiy ko\\u2018rsatkichlar\\nKo\\u2018rsatkich\\t2026\\t2028\\t2030\\nYangilangan fanlar soni\\t5\\t10\\t15\\nZamonaviy laboratoriyalar\\t2\\t4\\t8\\nScientific articles\\t10\\t25\\t40\\nInternational partner universities\\t1\\t2\\t3\\nStartup projects\\t1\\t2\\t3\\nIII. Expected General Results\\n\\u2022 modern engineering education\\n\\u2022 specialists in innovative and digital transport technologies\\n\\u2022 education integrated with industry\\n\\u2022 training in accordance with international standards\\n\\u2022 carrying out research in the field of transport\\n\\u2022 expansion of international cooperation.\\n\\u2022 Ensuring financial stability\\nConclusion\\nThe concept of development of the educational direction \\\"Vehicle Engineering (Road Transport)\\\" serves to train competitive, highly qualified and innovative-minded engineers for the transport sector. Research in the field will be developed. International cooperation will be expanded, innovations in the transport sector will be introduced. Innovative Transport Machinery Innovation Technopark is created. A mechanism of support for young scientists will be developed. Scientific laboratory centers of transport and mechanical engineering were established. The problems of production are explored, their solutions, practical proposals are developed, which are implemented in transport enterprises and organizations. The strategy for the development of the educational direction \\\"Vehicle Engineering (Road Transport)\\\" plays an important role in the modernization of the transport sector and the training of modern engineering personnel. Through the implementation of this strategy, a modern education system in the field of transport engineering will be formed, and a worthy contribution to the development of the transport network of the national economy will be made.\",\"\\u0647\\u0627\\u0630\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642\\u0633\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u06446 \\u062a\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637 \\u0628 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 Faculty of Service and Digitalization\"]}]', 'Department of Vehicle Engineering (Automotive & Transport Systems)', 'In 2020, a new structural unit was organized within the faculty of \"Mechanical Engineering and Architecture Construction\" - \"Fundamentals of Mechanics and Ground Transport Systems\". The establishment of this department arose from the need to train hi', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:50');
INSERT INTO `department_translations` (`id`, `department_id`, `locale`, `name`, `short_name`, `description`, `content_sections`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('46', '12', 'uz', 'Department of Vehicle Engineering (Automotive & Transport Systems)', 'Vehicle Engineering (Automotive & Transport Systems)', 'In 2020, a new structural unit was organized within the faculty of \"Mechanical Engineering and Architecture Construction\" - \"Fundamentals of Mechanics and Ground Transport Systems\". The establishment of this department arose from the need to train highly qualified specialists in the field of modern transport systems, agricultural engineering and mechanical engineering. The department\'s activity is directed on the development of engineering education, the organization of scientific and pedagogical activities on the study and rational use of transport technologies.', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"Umumiy ma\\u02bclumot\",\"items\":[\"Department of Vehicle Engineering     \\n\\nKafedra mudiri, Associate Professor\\nGaffarov Hasan Ravshanovich\\n Reception time: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\\n Phone: +998 97 306 07 37\\n Email: -\"]},{\"key\":\"history\",\"title\":\"Kafedra tarixi\",\"items\":[\"In 2020, a new structural unit was organized within the faculty of \\\"Mechanical Engineering and Architecture Construction\\\" - \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and Ground Transport Systems\\\". The establishment of this department arose from the need to train highly qualified specialists in the field of modern transport systems, agricultural engineering and mechanical engineering. The department\'s activity is directed on the development of engineering education, the organization of scientific and pedagogical activities on the study and rational use of transport technologies.\",\"1970-2019 \\u2013 M.M. Murodov., D.SH. Bazarbaeva., N.S.Bibutov., N.M.Muradov., SH. M. Muradov, Kh. R. Ruziev worked in the headship. In August 2019, the department was renamed into the chair \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and ETT\\\", and the chair was headed by Kh.R.Gaffarov.In 2021, due to the change in the internal structure of the Institute, the department \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics and ETT\\\" was divided into the departments \\\"Fundamentals of Mechanics\\\" and \\\"Engineering of vehicles\\\". As the head of the Department of \\\"Vehicle engineering\\\" is docent. Kh.R. Gaffarov works.\",\"Since 2021, the department has been renamed \\\"Department of Vehicle Engineering\\\" in accordance with the field. The name of the department was changed in order to expand the scientific and pedagogical activity of the department, to cover modern directions in the field of transport engineering and to bring the educational process into line with international requirements. In the initial period of creation of the department there were two directions, namely:\\n60810100 - Mechanization of agriculture,\\n\\u2022 5310600 - Land transport systems and their operation (motor transport).\\nDuring that period, 8 professors and teachers worked at the department. They include 1 associate professor, 2 senior lecturers, 3 assistants and 2 trainee teachers. At the department, education at the bachelor\'s level was initially provided, but the master\'s degree was not provided. In subsequent years, scientific and pedagogical potential and material and technical base of the department were significantly developed. As a result, the number of areas of education has been expanded, and today the department trains highly qualified personnel in 9 directions of education at the undergraduate level and 3 specialties at the master\'s level. Currently, 36 professors and staff work at the department. They include 1 professor, 12 associate professors, 3 senior lecturers, 7 assistants, 12 trainee teachers, and 2 laboratory assistants. The scientific and pedagogical team of the department pays special attention to the organization of the educational process on the basis of modern pedagogical technologies, strengthening the integration with the development and production of scientific research. In order to improve the educational process, the professors and teachers of the department have compiled more than 20 textbooks and teaching aids. They also publish a lot of scientific articles in national and international scientific journals and conduct research works in such areas as vehicle engineering, agricultural engineering, transport systems operation. This research contributes to the development of industry, increasing the efficiency of transport systems, as well as developing modern engineering solutions.\",\"Nowadays, the department \\\"Transport Engineering\\\" with its scientific potential, qualified professors and teaching staff is acting as one of the leading departments of the faculty.\"]},{\"key\":\"staff\",\"title\":\"Kafedra professor-o\\u2018qituvchilari\",\"items\":[\"Head of the department, candidate of technical sciences, Professor\\nGafforov Hasan Ravshanovich\",\"Candidate of the Technical Sciences, associate professor\\nUrinov Nasillo Fayzilloyevich\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD), associate professor\\nNorov Sobir Negmurodovich\",\"Associate Professor\\nSaidova Mukhabbat Khamroyevna\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD), associate professor\\nAmonov Mahmud Idris oglu\",\"Candidate of Technical Sciences, Associate Professor.\\nDuskarayev Nartaylak\",\"Doctor of philosophy (PhD) associate Professor\\nJurayev Toyir Omonovich\",\"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD),associate professor\\nAdizova Sevara Yusupovna\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nFazliyev Jamoliddin Sharofiddinovich\",\"Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nHakimova Zarina Ziyodilloyevna\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nXalilov Jahongir Mansur o\\u2019g\\u2019li\",\"Texnika fanlari falsafa doktori (PhD), dotsent\\nRajabov Bobir Bozorovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchit\\nKamolov Muhiddin Qurbonovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nBafoyev Dustmurod Xolmurodovich\",\"Katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nYuliyev Ozod Olimovich\",\"Assistent\\nSamandarov Ali Xayrullayevich\",\"Assistent\\nJumayev Ulug\\u2019bek Rustamovich\",\"Assistent\\nHaydarova Nargiza Dilmurod qizi\",\"Asistent\\nAbdullayeva Dilnavoz Xusniddinovna\",\"Assistent\\nHojiyev Oybek Odinayevich\"]},{\"key\":\"prepared_specialists\",\"title\":\"Tayyorlanadigan mutaxassislar\",\"items\":[\"BAKALAVRIAT\\n\\u2022 60712300 \\u2013 Mexanika muhandisligi\\n\\u2022 60711300 \\u2013 Metallar texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 60720300 \\u2013 Materialshunoslik\\n\\u2022 60810100 \\u2013 Qishloq xo\'jaligini mexanizatsiyalashtirish\\n\\u2022 60711400 \\u2013 Transport vositalari muhandisligi\\n\\u2022 60720800 \\u2013 Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi, mashinasozlik ishlab chiqarishini jihozlash va avtomatlashtirish\\n\\u2022 60720600 \\u2013Materialshunoslik va yangi materiallar texnologiyasi (mashinasozlik)\\n\\u2022 60712500 \\u2013 Transport vositalari muhandisligi (turlari bo\\u2018yicha) (avtomobil transporti)\\n\\u2022 60810100 \\u2013 Qishloq xo\'jaligini mexanizatsiyalashtirish (SIRTQI)\\nMAGISTRATURA\\n\\u2022 70712301- Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 70712301- Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi\\n\\u2022 70711401 - Transport vositalari muhandisligi (avtomobil transporti bo\\u2019yicha)\",\"KAFEDRADA O\\u2018QITILADIGAN FANLAR\\nBakalavriat:\\n1. Yo\\u2018nalishga kirish\\n2. Quymakorlik qotishmalari\\n3. Raqamli dasturda boshqariladigan texnologik jihozlar va tizimlar\\n4. Tokarlik ishi\\n5. Gidravlika\\n6. Kesish nazariyasi va kesuvchi asboblar\\n7. Materialshunoslik va muhandislik asoslari; integratsion yondashuv\\n8. Materialshunoslikning fundamental asoslari\\n9. Termik ishlov berish texnologiyasi\\n10. Nometall materiallar texnologiyasi\\n11. Gidravlika va gidravlik tizimlar\\n12. Materialshunoslik va konstruksion materiallar texnologiyasi\\n13. Tuproqshunoslik va dehqonchilik\\n14. Chorvachilik mahsulotlarini yetishtirish texnologiyasi\\n15. Zamonaviy kasblarga o\'rgatish\\/Tiklanuvchan energiya manbalari\\n16. Materialshunoslik\\n17. Gidravlika va gidravlik yuritmalar\\n18. Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi asoslari\\n19. Quymakorlik texnologiyalari\\n20. Mashinasozlik ishlab chiqarishini loyihalash\\n21. Zagotovkalarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n22. Yangi materiallar texnologiyasi\\n23. Korroziya va undan himoyalashning usullari\\n24. Metallarga bosim ostida ishlov berish\\n25. Materiallarni tuzilishi va detallar sifati nazorati\\n26. Kukun kompozitsion materiallar\\n27. Traktorlar va transport vositalari\\n28. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi mashinalari\\n29. Kasb mahorati\\/ Muhandislik-texnik ishlarni dasturiy modellashtirish\\n30. Aniq qishloq xo\'jalik tizimlari\\n31. Ichki yonuv dvigatellari\\/Yashil iqtisod\\n32. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi ishlab chiqarishni mexanizatsiyalashtirish\\/Yonilg\\u2019I moylash materiallari\\n33. Avtomatlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarish texnologiyasi\\n34. Avtomatlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarishning texnologik jihozlari\\n35. Mashinasozlikning maxsus kursi\\n36. Mashinasozlikda innovatsion texnika va texnologiyalar\\n37. Mashinasozlikda ishlab chiqarish jarayonlarini avtomatlashtirish asoslari\\n38. Frezalash ishi\\n39. Texnik tizimlarni boshqarish\\n40. Qizdirish qurilmalari\\n41. Kukunli kompozitsion materiallarvz\\n42. Quymakorlik texnologiyalari\\n43. Materiallar tuzilishi va detallar sifatini nazorati\\n44. Asbobsozlik materiallari\\n45. Korroziya va undan himoyalash usullari\\n46. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi ishlab chiqarishni mexanizatsialash\\n47. Yo\\u2019l harakati qoidalari va harakat xavfsizligi\\/ Bog\\u2019dorchilik va sabzavotchilik mashinalari\\n48. Qishloq xo\\u2019jalik texnika va texnologiyalardan foydalanish va texnik servis\\n49. Innavatsion texnika va ularning transferi\\n50. Mashinasozlik texnologiyasi (maxsus kurs)\\n51. Texnologik moslamalarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n52. Avtomatlashtirilgan uchastka va sexlarni loyihalash\\nMagistratura\\n1. Ilmiy tadqiqot metodologiyasi\\n2. Mashinasozlikda kesuvchi asboblarni loyihalash va ishlab chiqarish\\n3. Dastgohlar va dastgohli tizimlarni hisoblash va konstruksiyalash\\n4. Mashinalar va jarayonlar puxtaligi\\n5. Ilmiy-tadqiqot ishi va magistrlik dissertatsiyasini tayyorlash\\n6. Ilmiy-pedagogik ish\\n7. Mashinasozlikda resurstejamkor texnologiyalar\\n8. Mashinasozlikda aniqlik va uning texnologik ta\\u2019minoti\\n9. Raqamli dastur bilan boshqariladigan dastgohlar va dastgohli komplekslar\\n10. Maxsus fanlarni o\\u2018qitish metodikasi\\n11. Mashinasozlikda resurs tejamkor texnologiyalar\\n12. Ilmiy amaliyot (tajriba orttirish)\\n13. Transport vositalari va tizimlarining ishonchliligi loyihalash\\n14. Avtomobil transport vositalari va uni texnik ekspluatatsiyasining istiqbolli rivojlanishi\\n15. Texnologik jarayonlarini boshqarish va eksperimentlarini rejalashtirish\\n16. Avtomobillar texnik ekspluatatsiyasining meyorlarini aniqlashtirish usullari\\n17. Avtomobil transportida moddiy texnik ta\\u2019minot va resurslarni tejash\\n18. Avtotransport vositalarini ishlash qobiliyatini ta\\u2019minlash\\n19. Qiyosiy muhandislik\\n20. Qishloq xo\\u2019jalik mashinalarining yangi texnik yechimlari\\n21. Qishloq xo\\u2019jaligi mashinalari nazariyasi hisobi\\n22. Ilmiy tadqiqot usullari va eksplatatsiyasi\"]},{\"key\":\"publications\",\"title\":\"Darsliklar va maqolalar\",\"items\":[\"DARSLIK VA O\\u2018QUV QO\\u2018LLANMALAR\\n1. O\'rinov U.A., Amonov M.I., Yo\'ldoshev M.N. \\u201cMashinasozlik texnologiyasi asoslari\\u201d \\u2013 Buxoro. \\u201cSharq\\u201d nashriyoti. 2025y.\\n2. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u0410vtotransport tarmog\\u02bci korxonalarni loyihalash va jihozlash Darslik. Buxoro: Umid 2023, 444 b.\\n3. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u201c\\u0410vtomobillarni texnik diagnostikalash\\u201d Darslik. Buxoro: Umid. 2023, 216 b.\\n4. Kamolov M.Q., Gaffarov H.R. \\u201cTransport vositalarining elektr jihozlari va elektron tizimlari\\u2