tbooks.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0639\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u062d\\u062b\\u064a\\u0629\",\"items\":[\"K\\u0430f\\u0435dr\\u0430d\\u0430 h\\u043ezirgi kund\\u0430 4 t\\u0430 ilmiy yo\\u2019n\\u0430lishd\\u0430 ilmiy ishl\\u0430r \\u043elib b\\u043erilm\\u043eqd\\u0430.\\n\\u20031. Sp\\u0435ktr\\u0430l t\\u0430hlil ilmiy yo\\u2019n\\u0430lishi bo\\u2019yich\\u0430- pr\\u043ef\\u0435ss\\u043er S.\\u0425.\\u0410st\\u0430n\\u043ev r\\u0430hb\\u0430rligid\\u0430 ilmiy ishl\\u0430r \\u043elib b\\u043erilm\\u043eqd\\u0430.\",\"2. Scientific work on the scientific direction of neurological egenetics is carried out in the journal of \\u041e.S.K\\u043emil\\u043ev.\",\"3. K\\u043end\\u0435nsirl\\u0430ng\\u0430n v\\u0430 n\\u0430n\\u043e\' \\u2013 measured systems of functional and p\\u0430r\\u0430m\\u0435tric h\\u043edis\\u0430l\\u0430r m\\u0430vzu m.f.d. Scientific work of M.R.Jum\\u0430ev is carried out.\",\"4. Spin \\u2013 the natural structure of the natural structure of gravity and the scientific direction of the m\\u0430gnit\\u00f6ptic properties of the transition \\u2013 f-m.f.d. M.Z.SH Scientific work is not going on in the Republic of Uzbekistan.\"]}]', 'العلوم الدقيقة', 'The department was organized in 1972 on the basis of the Bukhara branch of the former Tashkent Polytechnic Institute. The department is headed by prof. M.N.Rakhmatov, prof. M.T.Toshev, prof. S.Kh.Astanov and Ph.D. M.Z.Sharipov, Ph.D., was headed by a', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:55');
INSERT INTO `department_translations` (`id`, `department_id`, `locale`, `name`, `short_name`, `description`, `content_sections`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('73', '19', 'en', 'Uzbek and Foreign Languages', 'Uzbek and Foreign Languages', 'Department of Uzbek and Foreign Languages     \n\nYusupova Shoxida Batirovna\n Reception time: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\n Phone: +998 (93) 623 74 72\n Email: -', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"Overview\",\"items\":[\"Department of Uzbek and Foreign Languages     \\n\\nYusupova Shoxida Batirovna\\n Reception time: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\\n Phone: +998 (93) 623 74 72\\n Email: -\"]},{\"key\":\"staff\",\"title\":\"Professor-Teachers of the Department\",\"items\":[\"Head of Department, PhD, Associate Professor\\nYusupova Shohida Batirovna\",\"Doctor of Philology, Professor\\nJuraeva Malohat Mukhammedovna\",\"Doctor of Philosophy, Professor\\nYunusova Gulandom Samiyevna\",\"p.f.f.n., dotsent\\nKazimova Gulnora Hakimovna\",\"p.f.f.d. (PhD), dotsent\\nBarotova Mubashira Barotovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nMuhamedjanova Sitora Jamalitdinovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nRajabova Marjona Ahmadovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nAlimova Nozima Rajabboyevna\",\"PhD, dotsent v.b.\\nNarzullayeva Dilfuza Saitovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nIbotova Nasiba Komilovna\",\"dotsent\\nNurmuradova Shahnoz Ibragimovna\",\"dotsent\\nBarakatova Dilorom Aminovna\",\"dotsent\\nKamolova Dilfuza Obidovna\",\"dotsent\\nSaitova Komila Xasanboyevna\",\"dotsent\\nTillayeva Shahlo Maksudovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nKaramatova Zarina Fatilloyevna\",\"dotsent\\nSalomova Malika Zohirovna\",\"dotsent\\nKazakova Dilora Gaffarovna\",\"dotsent\\nShoyimqulova Mahzuna Shavkatovna\",\"dotsent\\nAxmedova Gulshod Umarovna\",\"p.f.f.d. (PhD),\\nTsukanova Yelena Nikolayevna\"]},{\"key\":\"prepared_specialists\",\"title\":\"Prepared Specialists\",\"items\":[\"Bakalavriat\\nO\\u2019zbek va xorijiy tillar kafedrasi universitetning barcha bakalavr ta\\u2019lim yo\\u2019nalishlariga dars beradi.\\nDoktorantura.\\n10.00.06 \\u2013Qiyosiy adabiyotshunoslik, chog\\u2018ishtirma tilshunoslik va tarjimashunoslik;\\n10.00.04 \\u2013 Yevropa, Amerika va Avstraliya xalqlari tili va adabiyoti.\",\"KAFEDRADA O\\u2018QITILADIGAN FANLAR\\nBakalavriat:\\n1. ingliz tili;\\n2. nemis tili;\\n3. frantsuz tili;\\n4. rus tili;\\n5. o\\u2019zbek tili;\\n6. nutq madaniyati;\\n7. akademik yozuv;\\n8. o\\u2019zbek tilining sohada qo\\u2019llanilishi;\"]},{\"key\":\"publications\",\"title\":\"Textbooks and Articles\",\"items\":[\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u043c\\u0430\\u043b\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430 \\u0414.\\u041e. \\u201c\\u0420\\u0443\\u0441\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u044f\\u0437\\u044b\\u043a\\u201d. Textbook 2022 Sharipova\\nF.N. \\\"History of Architecture\\\". Textbook Sharipova F.N\\n. \\\"Architecture\\\" in 2021 year Textbook 2022.\\nBarotova M. B. \\\"Problems of recreating the creative style in direct English translation of the works of Erkin A\'zam\\\" Textbook 2022. Sayitovo\\nK. H., Mamedova M. A. \\\"English for oil and gas industry\\\". Textbook 2022 Sayitovo\\nK. H. English (for Masters of Non-Linguistic Specialties). Textbook 2022 Tillaeva\\nSh.M \\\"English for Weaving Industry\\\" Textbook 2023\\nSalomova M.Z.Sharipova F.N.Kazakova D.G. \\\"Construction engineering\\\". Textbook 2023 Shoyimkulova\\nM.Sh. \\\"Technical English For Technological Processes\\\" Textbook 2023 Akhmedova\\nG.U \\\"Deutsch\\\" Textbook 2023.\\nMustakimova \\u049a.S. \\\"Uzbek language\\\" Darslik 2023 yil.\\nNurmuradova Sh.I., Kamalova D.O., Barakatova D.A. \\\"Russian language\\\" Darslik 2024 year.\\nKamalova D.O. \\\"Russian Language\\\" Darslik 2024 year.\\nSalomova M.Z. \\\"English\\\" Textbook 2024.\\nSharipova F.N. \\\"English\\\" textbook 2024 year.\\nNurmuradova Sh.I. \\\"Textbook on the Russian Language for 1st Year Students of All Directions of Non-Linguistic Universities\\\" Darslik 2024 yil.\\nSayitovo K. X. English (for the students of non-linguistic higher educational institutions). Textbook 2024 Kazakova\\nD.G. \\\"ENGLISH\\\"5340100\\u2013 Architecture (by type), 5340200 \\u2013 Construction of buildings and structures (industrial and civil buildings) for students. Textbook 2024.\\nKazakova D.G. \\\"English language\\\"(English) textbook 2024 year.\\nAlimova N.R.\\\"English language\\\" (For all non-philological direction 2nd year students) Textbook 2024 year.\\nSayidova S.Y. \\\"Russian Language\\\" Textbook 2024 year.\\nSayidova S.Y. \\\"Russian Language\\\" Darslik 2024 year.\\nAkhmedova G.U. \\\"Deutsch f\\u00fcr IT-Studenten\\\" textbook 2025 year.\\nShoyimkulova M.Sh. \\\"Economics as a science\\\" Textbook 2025.\\nBarotova M.B., Bakhramova Z.R. \\\"English language\\\" Textbook 2025 year.\\nM.A.Radjabova \\\"Let\'s learn English\\\"(For the second course students). Textbook 2025 year.\\n. S.D.Mukhamedzhanova \\\"English for medical students\\\" Textbook 2025 year.\\nSharipova F.N. \\\"Architecture of Uzbekistan\\\" Textbook 2026 year.\\nKamalova D.O. \\\"Textbook on the Russian Language\\\" 2021.\\nKazimova G.Kh. \\\"Fundamentals of Philosophy\\\" Textbook.2021\\nTillayeva Sh.M \\\"English for Leather Industry\\\" Textbook 2022\\nShoyimkulova M.Sh. \\\"English for Economists\\\" Textbook 2022yil\\nKaramatova.Z.F \\\"English\\\"\\nKazimova G.Kh. \\\"Textbook on the Russian Language\\\"2022\"]},{\"key\":\"activities\",\"title\":\"Activities of the Department\",\"items\":[\"\\u201cO\\u2019zbek tili va xorijiy tillar\\u201d kafedrasi professor-o\\u2019qituvchilari f.f.d.,professor dunyo reytingida 630 o\\u2019rinda turuvchi Auezov nomidagi Janubiy Qozog\\u2019iston universitetida tashkil qilingan \\u201cSmart Learning: Enhancing Foreign Language Teaching Competence through Linguodidactics and Digital Tools\\u201d (Aqlli ta\\u2019lim: lingvodidaktika va raqamli vositalar yordamida chet tillarni o\\u2018qitish mahoratini oshirish) nomli konferentsiyada o\\u2019z ma\\u2019ruzalari bilan qatnashdilar.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Research Work\",\"items\":[\"Tillayeva Sh.M. \\\"Current theory and practice issues of teaching foreign languages\\\" Monografiya 2024 year\\nBarakatova D.A. \\\"Basic functions of dialectal vocabulary in modern language\\\" Monografiya 2024 yil\\nSalomova M.Z. Language teaching methodology\\\" Monograph 2024 Sharipova\\nF.N. \'Methods and approaches in vocabulary teaching and their influence on students\' \\\"That\\nwas the M.Sh.\\\" The role of modern technology in teaching English.\\\" Monografiya 2024 year\\nNurmuradova Sh.I. \\\"Semantico-pragmatic potential of an uncodified word\\\". Monograph 2024\\nAsrarova M. U.\\\" Qomusiy scientist of the oriental renaissance period (based on the translation of the works of M.N. Boltaev)\\\" Monograph 2024 year Sidikova\\nN.N.\\\" Actual issues of the organization of continuous study of foreign languages in all spheres of the education system in Uzbekistan\\\" Monograph: 2024. Izzatyllaeva\\nG. N. \\\"The role of believers in the development of youth thinking\\\" Monograph: 2024.\\nKazakova D.G. \\\"Working with authentic materials in teaching reading\\\" Monograph: 2024\\n. Musta\\u04b7imova \\u049a.S. \\\"National-cultural features of the modern language of advertising\\\" Monograph, 2025.\\nKaramatova Z.F. Typological features of the genre of elegy and marcia (on the example of English and Uzbek poetry) Monograph 2025 Shoyimkulova\\nM.Sh \\\"The role of modern technology in teaching English\\\" Monograph 2025 Karamatova\\nZ.F. \\\"World and uzbek poetry\\\" Monograph 2026 year\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"Cooperation\",\"items\":[\"Delegations from more than 100 countries of the world took part in the V International Kostomarov Forum, which was held in Moscow with the support of the Pushkin Institute of Russian Language and UNESCO. \\ud83d\\udcda During the forum, issues of promoting the Russian language, modern methodology, innovations in education, Russian language and intercultural communication were discussed. Akhtam Sariyev, a teacher of the Bukhara State Technical University, also took part in the delegation of Uzbekistan. He lectured on \\\"The functional state of the Russian language in Uzbekistan\\\" and \\\"Problems with methodological literature in higher educational institutions of Bukhara region\\\". This forum became an important platform for intercultural cooperation and the opportunity to learn best practices in teaching Russian language.\"]},{\"key\":\"plans\",\"title\":\"Prospective Plans\",\"items\":[\"In order to further increase their academic potential, teachers of the department participate in the Faculty Enrichment Program (FEP) at conferences and seminars organized by the British Council and the English Language Teachers\' Association. Therefore, a library with French literature is being established in cooperation with the French Embassy. Teachers record and publish over 80 textbooks, teaching materials, bilingual dictionaries. Lecturers also participate in scientific seminars and conferences with their articles in collections of conferences and scientific journals, both at home and abroad. The teaching of English and French languages, modern advanced methods and principles and the experience of developed countries are used in the teaching of English and French languages.\",\"\\u0644\\u064a\\u0643\\u0646 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0643 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0646 \\u0643\\u0644 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642\\u0633\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0627\\u0635\\u0647 \\u0628\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0643\\u0644 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0647 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 6 \\u0627\\u0642\\u0633\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u062c\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a 24 \\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\n\\u0648\\u0643\\u0644 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u062